External inputs
---------------
Four inputs under data/ originate outside this study and are redistributed
under the terms of their sources, not under this licence. Each is reduced to
the rows and columns the analysis reads.

  data/ibioid/go_string/*.tsv
  data/ibioid/go_enrichment/*.tsv
  data/ibiocofrac/m11/go_enrichment/*.tsv
      Functional enrichment computed on this study's gene lists by STRING
      (string-db.org), v12.0. STRING data are released under CC BY 4.0.

  data/external/syngo_1.3_Lrrk2_WT_ontologies_with_annotations.xlsx
      Synapse enrichment computed on this study's gene list by SynGO
      (syngoportal.org), release 1.3, run 2026-08-03. See SynGO for its terms.

  data/external/PanglaoDB_markers_27_Mar_2020.tsv
      Cell-type markers from PanglaoDB (panglaodb.se), 27 March 2020 release,
      reduced to the mouse brain rows of the six cell types used and the four
      columns read. See PanglaoDB for its terms.

  data/external/annotation.BrainCellAtlas_Saunders_version_2018.04.01.csv
      Cluster annotation from the Saunders et al. mouse brain atlas, version
      2018.04.01, reduced to the substantia nigra rows. See the source for its
      terms.

